      <DisplayName>Arcane Reactor Tablet</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures\GUI\Icons\ArcanePower\Tablet.dds</Icon>
      <Description>Read-only reactor telemetry on the tablet screen.

CONNECTION
Enable the suit antenna.
Requires an accessible, bidirectional grid antenna link.

CONTROLS
Equip the tablet.
Left click: select a reachable reactor.
Right click: change page.</Description>
